   (extra time and the eye-contact accommodation), then updated for GAD-T307's pass across the whole app, GAD-T507's WCAG 2.2
   checks, the exam room's keyboard and timing fixes (GAD-T599), the languages work (GAD-T526) and the live examiner (GAD-T692); text in
   Localization/Strings/site.<lang>.json (GAD-T592). It states a target and what was checked and fixed, not a conformance
